    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just not just \"stress.\" it feels permanent. like there's no version of the future where this isn't happening. it's like i'm stuck in a loop of losing everything and i just want it all to stop. i'm just so tired of fighting for a life that doesn't even feel like mine anymore.",
